@using BRaVe_Portal.Models
@using BRaVe_Portal.Models.DTOs
@model BRaVe_Portal.Pages.Distributions.DistributionsMappingModel
@{
    CoreLookups coreLookups = (CoreLookups)ViewData["CoreLookups"];
    var lookups = coreLookups?.UOM ?? new List<LookupItemDto>();
}
<style>
    .selected-item-chip {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        background: #e3f2fd;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 13px;
        border: 1px solid #bbdefb;
    }

    .remove-chip-btn {
        border: none;
        background: none;
        color: #c62828;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 14px;
    }
</style>
<div class="modal fade" id="AddKitItemModal" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered">
        <div class="modal-content shadow-sm border-0 rounded-3">


            <div class="modal-header bg-light">
                <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">Add Kits To Distribution : @Model.DistributionTitle</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
            </div>

            <div class="modal-body">

                <form method="post"
                      asp-page-handler="AddKitItem"
                      id="AddKitForm">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()

                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="Description" />
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="DistributionTitle" />
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="DistributionExternalId" />
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="distributionId" />
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="TenantId" />
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="SelectedIKits" id="SelectedIKits" />

                    <div style="background-color:#f5f5f5; border-left:4px solid #9e9e9e; padding:10px; margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; color:#333;">
                        <strong></strong>
                        Distribution Description <b>@Model.Description</b> External Id <b>@Model.DistributionExternalId</b>.
                        <br />
                    </div>

                    <br />
                    <div class="mb-3">

                        <button type="button"
                                class="btn d-flex align-items-center gap-2"
                                style="background-color:#0d47a1; color:white;"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#ItemTagAssignmentCollapse">

                            <i class="fa fa-box"></i>
                            <span>Select Kits</span>

                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark ms-2"
                                  id="selectedItemCount">0</span>

                            <i class="fa fa-chevron-down ms-auto text-light"></i>

                        </button>

                    </div>


                    <div class="collapse" id="ItemTagAssignmentCollapse">

                        <div class="card card-body border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3">

                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold d-flex justify-content-between">
                                Kits
                                <small class="text-muted">
                                    <span id="itemsCount">0</span> selected
                                </small>
                            </label>

                            <!-- Searchable input -->
                            <input type="text"
                                   id="itemSearchInput"
                                   class="form-control mb-3"
                                   placeholder="Search items..." />

                            <!-- Available items container -->
                            <div id="availableItemsContainer" class="list-group mb-3" style="max-height: 300px; overflow-y:auto;">
                                @foreach (var kit in Model.KitTypes)
                                {
                                    <div class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center item-row"
                                         data-id="@kit.Id"
                                         data-name="@kit.Name"
                                         data-notes="@kit.Notes">
                                        <div>
                                            <strong>@kit.Name</strong>
                                            <div class="text-muted small">@kit.Notes</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary add-item-btn">
                                            <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            </div>

                            <!-- Selected items container -->
                            <div>
                                <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Selected Kits</label>
                                <div id="selectedItemsContainer" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2"></div>

                            </div>

                            <!-- Hidden input for form -->
                            <input type="hidden" asp-for="SelectedItemIds" id="SelectedItemIds" />

                            <div class="mt-3 d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="clearSelections">
                                    Clear
                                </button>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">

                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success">
                            <i class="fa fa-save me-1"></i> Save
                        </button>

                        <button type="button"
                                class="btn btn-secondary"
                                data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                            Cancel
                        </button>

                    </div>

                </form>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<script>
    const unitsOfMeasure = @Html.Raw(Json.Serialize(lookups));

    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {

        const modal = document.getElementById("AddKitItemModal");

        modal.addEventListener("shown.bs.modal", function () {

            const availableContainer = document.getElementById("availableItemsContainer");
            const selectedContainer = document.getElementById("selectedItemsContainer");
            const hiddenInput = document.getElementById("SelectedIKits");
            const clearBtn = document.getElementById("clearSelections");
            const searchInput = document.getElementById("itemSearchInput");
            const countDisplay = document.getElementById("itemsCount");
            const badgeCount = document.getElementById("selectedItemCount");
                    function refreshHidden() {
                                const chips = selectedContainer.querySelectorAll(".selected-item-chip");

                                let values = [];

                                chips.forEach(chip => {
                                    const id = chip.dataset.id;
                                    const qtyInput = chip.querySelector(".qty-input");
                                    const qty = qtyInput ? qtyInput.value : 1;

                                    values.push(id + ":" + qty);
                                });

                                hiddenInput.value = values.join(",");
                                countDisplay.textContent = chips.length;
                                badgeCount.textContent = chips.length;

                                console.log(hiddenInput.value);
                            }

                                          function createChip(id, name) {

                    const chip = document.createElement("div");
                    chip.className = "selected-item-chip";
                    chip.dataset.id = id;

                    chip.innerHTML = `
                        <span style="min-width:120px;">${name}</span>

                       <input type="number" min="1" step="1" value="1"
                           class="form-control form-control-sm qty-input"
                           style="width:80px;"
                           placeholder="Qty">

                        <button type="button" class="remove-chip-btn">
                            <i class="fa fa-times"></i>
                        </button>
                    `;

                    chip.querySelector(".qty-input").addEventListener("input", refreshHidden);

                    chip.querySelector(".remove-chip-btn").addEventListener("click", function () {
                        chip.remove();
                        refreshHidden();
                    });

                    selectedContainer.appendChild(chip);
                    refreshHidden();
                }

            function addItem(row) {
                const id = row.dataset.id;
                const name = row.dataset.name;

                if (selectedContainer.querySelector(`[data-id='${id}']`)) return;

                createChip(id, name);
            }

            availableContainer.querySelectorAll(".add-item-btn").forEach(btn => {
                btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    const row = btn.closest(".item-row");
                    addItem(row);
                });
            });

            clearBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                selectedContainer.innerHTML = "";
                hiddenInput.value = "";
                countDisplay.textContent = 0;
                badgeCount.textContent = 0;
            });

            // REAL-TIME SEARCH
           searchInput.addEventListener("input", function () {
                const term = searchInput.value.toLowerCase();

                availableContainer.querySelectorAll(".item-row").forEach(row => {
                    const name = (row.dataset.name || "").toLowerCase();
                    const notes = (row.dataset.notes || "").toLowerCase();

                    if (name.includes(term) || notes.includes(term)) {
                        row.style.display = "";
                    } else {
                        row.style.display = "none";
                    }
                });
            });

        });
    });
</script>